<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8">
  <title>Horror Street - 9:00 PM Entity</title>
  <style>
    body {
      margin: 0;
      overflow: hidden;
      background-color: #000;
      color: #fff;
      font-family: 'Courier New', Courier, monospace;
      user-select: none;
    }
    #canvas-container {
      width: 100vw;
      height: 100vh;
    }
    #ui {
      position: absolute;
      top: 20px;
      left: 20px;
      z-index: 10;
      pointer-events: none;
    }
    .hud-text {
      font-size: 20px;
      color: #ff3333;
      text-shadow: 0 0 5px #000;
      margin-bottom: 5px;
    }
    #crosshair {
      position: absolute;
      top: 50%;
      left: 50%;
      width: 6px;
      height: 6px;
      background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.5);
      border-radius: 50%;
      transform: translate(-50%, -50%);
      pointer-events: none;
      z-index: 10;
    }
    #overlay {
      position: absolute;
      top: 0;
      left: 0;
      width: 100vw;
      height: 100vh;
      background: rgba(0,0,0,0.85);
      display: flex;
      flex-direction: column;
      justify-content: center;
      align-items: center;
      z-index: 20;
    }
    #overlay h1 { font-size: 42px; color: #cc0000; margin-bottom: 10px; }
    #overlay p { font-size: 18px; color: #ccc; margin-bottom: 20px; }
    #start-btn {
      padding: 12px 24px;
      font-size: 18px;
      background: #440000;
      color: #fff;
      border: 1px solid #ff0000;
      cursor: pointer;
    }
    #start-btn:hover { background: #880000; }
  </style>
</head>
<body>

  <div id="ui">
    <div class="hud-text" id="clock">TIME: 08:30 PM</div>
    <div class="hud-text" id="status" style="font-size: 14px; color: #aaa;">Status: Street is quiet...</div>
  </div>

  <div id="crosshair"></div>

  <div id="overlay">
    <h1>THE DARK STREET</h1>
    <p>Survive the night. Do not let IT catch you after 9:00 PM.</p>
    <p>Controls: WASD = Move | Mouse = Look</p>
    <button id="start-btn">ENTER STREET</button>
  </div>

  <div id="canvas-container"></div>

